[37.457923, "o", "\r\r\n  [ok] the added disk is there -- 2 storage device(s)\r\r\n  [ok] the disks are parallels as asked -- reported ['parallels']\r\r\n  [ok] the disks are on ide as asked -- reported ['ide']\r\r\n$ vmctl -p virtualbox export vmctl-t-parallels-ide-ov -o C:\\Users\\aaaha\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\vmctl-handson-56bwp4io\\vmctl-t-parallels-ide.json\r\r\n  Exported 'vmctl-t-parallels-ide-ov' -> C:\\Users\\aaaha\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\vmctl-handson-56bwp4io\\vmctl-t-parallels-ide.json\r\r\n  -> exit 0\r\r\n  [ok] export writes the file\r\r\n  [ok] a .json file contains JSON\r\r\n"]
